      "content": "i just finished the final movement. it's done. everything i ever wanted to say, everything i ever wanted to pull out of the silence... it's finally on the page. and now that it's here, i feel this strange, heavy stillness. like there's just nothing left to reach for. the silence that follows is going to be much harder to deal with than the silence that came before.",
